  Format: {H(1),H(2),H(3),H(4),H(5),H(6),H(7)}, where H(n) denotes $\widehat{H}_{n}^{(1)}$.
  Notations:  T=-t/s, qq=1-T-U, \[Mu]\[Mu]=\[Mu]^2/s
  Flag Nf=1 marks the contributions coming from diagrams with fermionic loop.
*)
{2 + ((2*I)*Pi*(-2*(1 - T) - 2*T + 3*(1 - T)*T + 2*T^2))/((-1 + T)*T) - 
  ((4*I)*Pi*(-1 + T)*G[{T^(-1)}, 1])/T^2 + 
